gossip.h3_f:
hoʻolaha = {pubkey, endpoint, advertised_at}
sig = Ed25519-Sign(pubkey_priv, CBOR(hoʻolaha))
ka ukana ʻōlelo ʻino: [..., {ad, sig}, ...]

mea hoʻokipa: hōʻoia i ka hōʻailona kūʻē iā ad.pubkey → hale kūʻai inā ʻae
mea hou aku: PoW o 2^18 mau helu mua ma {pubkey, endpoint}

stealth.h2_f:
ClientHello bytes = chrome_120_template me {
  random = kā mākou random,
  server_name = ko mākou inoa hoʻokipa (a i ʻole ECH-wrapped),
  session_id = kā mākou hui id,
}
JA4 = t13d_xxxx_xxxx_xxxx (kūlike me Chrome stable)

stealth.h4_f:
DoH: POST https://cloudflare-dns.com/dns-query {inoa: x.vortexx.sol}
ECH: ClientHello.extensions += encrypted_sni(public_key_from_HTTPS_record)
DGA: domain(t) = base32( SHA256(hua ∥ YYYY-MM-DD) )[:16] + ".example"

push.h4_f:
iOS NSE: didLoaʻa(noi) { hoʻokaʻawale (request.content.userInfo) }
Android FCM: onMessageReceived(remoteMessage) { decrypt(remoteMessage.data) }
Pūnaewele SW: self.addEventListener('push', e => decrypt(e.data))

